{"id":"udzec","name":"Udzec","type":"location","aliases":["the Monolith"],"description":"Prison where Zita is held.","pages":5,"first_seen":"2019-01-23","last_seen":"2019-01-30","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kodolaag","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Kodolaag\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e7","summary":"At Udzec, Olrich dresses as a baby and swallows the bloodfray amulet, and Kodolaag frames the minotaur Jitka Wothis by hiding a whiskey bottle in her cape to distract the nullmages.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","jitka-wothis","bloodfray-amulet","udzec"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":379,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"Carefully, carefully I rest the bottle inside, hoping it's light enough not to pull the fabric.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e8","summary":"Kodolaag fin