ork":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e10","summary":"Olrich impersonates Dovin Baan to hold off a soldier, and the trio walks out among exiting visitors.","participants":["olrich","kodolaag","zita","dovin-baan"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":379,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":150,"quote":"Citizens! Behold! It is I, your highly esteemed Grand Arbiter, Protector of Justice, Purveyor of Protocols!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e11","summary":"Jitka Wothis and a vampire identify Kodolaag and Olrich, who are bound by magic; Zita escapes into the crowd.","participants":["jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich","zit